        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Blood Frenzy"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(rage)\n\nTrigger: The sea devil deals bleed damage to a living creature.\n\nThe sea devil flies into a frenzy that lasts 1 minute. While frenzied, the sea devil gains a +1 status bonus to attack rolls with its claws and jaws, gains a +4 status bonus to damage rolls with its claws and jaws, gains 7 temporary HP until the end of the frenzy, and takes a \u20132 status penalty to AC. The sea devil can't voluntarily stop its frenzy. After its frenzy, the sea devil is fatigued."
            },
